{"ts":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-5.6-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9b054e739855a3b67742faac","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-5.6-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-a8zm","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Matrix dimensions\n\n- Requirement: every MUST, MUST NOT, REQUIRED, supported SHOULD, removed behavior, deprecation, and error code from the official schema and changelog.\n- Surface: public SDK, stdio process, Streamable HTTP process, MCP tools, resources, prompts, tasks, skills, Apps, docs, contracts, and schemas.\n- Era: 2026-07-28 canonical plus every explicitly supported legacy probe and refusal.\n- Outcome: positive case, malformed case, missing-capability case, unsupported-version case, concurrency case, disconnect or retry case, authorization case, resource-bound case, and negative control.\n- Artifact: checkout, packed tarball, clean install, npm package, npx, bunx, and release metadata.\n- Scale: deterministic ordering, prompt-cache stability, bounded output, large schema, many tools or resources, long history, and concurrent clients.\n- Evidence: exact source revision, exact package version, exact commit, exact test command, gate verdict, and immutable pm record."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-55yf1t"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"MCP 2026-07-28 conformance and release gate: official schema matrix, protocol-era adapters, real transports, adversarial cases, and published consumers"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Build a requirement-complete test and release gate that proves the SDK, stdio server, Streamable HTTP server, packages, docs, and published artifacts implement the declared 2026-07-28 surface."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:mcp","ci","conformance","negative-control","published-artifact","real-process","release-gate"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-12-15T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":1200},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A generated matrix maps every official 2026-07-28 normative requirement and supported extension to owners and executable evidence with no unclassified row; Official schema fixtures and protocol-era tests run through the public SDK and real stdio and Streamable HTTP processes; Each major behavior has a negative control that demonstrates the gate fails when the behavior is removed or malformed; Concurrency, cancellation, disconnect, retry, replay, authorization, caching, resource bounds, and token ceilings have adversarial coverage; Packed, npm, npx, and bunx consumers execute the full canonical agent journey and verify the advertised protocol version; Release is refused if source, generated schemas, docs, contracts, server discovery, package metadata, or published behavior disagree"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"Evidence-backed MCP conformance"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Turn every normative requirement and supported extension into executable local, hosted, packed, and published proof"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Protocol drift, false-green tests, legacy regressions, security mistakes, and broken package bins fail before release"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The existing handshake test proves an obsolete revision and the release probe validates only initialize rather than the latest protocol and extensions"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-rs9vry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"critical"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-3zh9s4","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-8nzivt","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-9rgaal","kind":"verifies","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-hv1x1x","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-pznhee","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-rs9vry","kind":"verifies","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-rz9gep","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-rzs24j","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:12:34.029Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-v7e337","kind":"blocked_by","created_at